   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a lean man in his forties, short dark hair combed back, clean-shaven, wearing a charcoal grey three-piece suit, a white shirt, a narrow black silk tie and one silver wristwatch on his left wrist only.\n\nsummary:\n<Subject 1> waits alone on a night train platform, checks his single silver watch, then turns his head as a train's light grows in the tunnel. Calm, slow, no fast action.\n\ndetailed_description:\nCinematic live action, shot on 35mm film, shallow depth of field, soft grain, cool blue night light with warm sodium lamps above the platform. Slow dolly-in at chest height. <Subject 1> stands still beside a green iron pillar, charcoal grey three-piece suit, narrow black silk tie, one silver wristwatch on the left wrist. He lifts the left wrist and reads the single silver watch, lowers it, then turns his head toward the tunnel as a white headlight grows in the dark. His expression stays calm and focused.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet platform room tone, a faint electric hum from the lamps, the soft tick of the watch, a distant train rumble slowly growing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A - no score, no soundtrack, no musical arrangement at any point.",
